  "description": "A comprehensive C# utility library that simplifies daily .NET development with rich extension methods and helper classes. Extensions: Bool, String, Int, Float, Double, Decimal, Enum, DataTable, DateTime, File, Stream, Enumerable, and more. Helpers: HttpClientHelper, FileHelper, WebSocketHelper, RegexHelper, TaskHelper, UnitHelper, StopwatchHelper, ReflectHelper, ApplicationHelper, DataTableHelper, and more. Targets .NET Standard 2.1 and .NET 8.0+. C# 综合工具类库，提供丰富的扩展方法与帮助类，简化日常 .NET 开发。",
